      "role": "user",
      "content": "The pro side is pretty solid. But looking at that second part, it feels a bit too easy for the student to just brush off. Can you try writing a version of the anti-nuclear argument that's actually intellectually challenging? Something that would make the pro-deterrence side really sweat during the debate?",
